From: axon7m bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] audio: default HAL: mixer routes and wired devices on the primary card

- StreamPrimary sets the card's mixer for the connected device from the
  file named by ro.vendor.audio.tinyalsa.routes ([speaker], [earpiece],
  [headphones], [mic], [headset-mic]; "control = value" lines).
- Devices without a CARD_x_DEV_y address (wired headsets, named by the
  framework) use ro.vendor.audio.tinyalsa.default_{in,out}_address.
- ModulePrimary accepts analog (wired) device connections; the stock
  Module refuses external devices unless the module overrides
  populateConnectedDevicePort.
